      "id": "thm-increasing-functions-split-uniquely-as-jump-plus-continuous",
      "statement": "For a nondecreasing F on [a,b], its specified jump function J_F and C_F=F-J_F are nondecreasing, C_F is continuous, and the jump data determine J_F pointwise.",
